details.returned_prompt:
{
  "high_level_description": "An editorial outdoor photograph of a hiker pausing on a rocky fell path in northern England to tend to a pair of well-worn brown leather boots, with rolling green fells receding into hazy distance under soft overcast daylight, shot on a 50mm lens with fine Kodak Portra grain.",
  "compositional_deconstruction": {
    "background": "Rolling green fells of northern England receding into hazy blue distance under a pale slate overcast sky, soft diffused daylight from above with no harsh shadows. A small tarn catches the pale sky reflected in a valley fold in the mid-distance. The foreground is a rocky fell path with mossy grass and scattered heather, slightly out of focus near the lens edge.",
    "elements": [
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Weathered canvas rucksack slumped on the grass behind the boots in the midground-left, softly resolved. Faded olive-tan canvas with worn leather straps, a coiled length of cream climbing rope clipped to one side and a battered enamel mug with chipped white-and-blue rim hanging from the other."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Pair of sturdy brown full-grain leather hiking boots set on a flat moss-edged rock just left of center in the midground, sharp focus. The left boot stands upright with a wad of crumpled newspaper stuffed inside the shaft; the right boot lies tipped on its side showing a waxed toe cap with a faint sheen catching the diffused light."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Soft-bristled shoe brush resting against the upright boot, wooden handle and bristles dusted with dried mud. Beside it sits an open small tin of leather wax with a folded grey rag draped over the rim, wax visible inside the tin."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Hiker's hands entering from the right edge of the frame at chest height, sleeves of a faded olive wool jumper pushed up to the forearms. Medium skin tone, fingers just finishing a wiping motion across the waxed toe cap of the tipped boot. Body stays out of frame."
      },
      {
        "type": "obj",
        "desc": "Tufts of rust-orange heather and yellow gorse scattered along the foreground rock edge, slightly out of focus near the lens, framing the lower portion of the scene."
      }
    ]
  }
}
